==Event Information==
<!--Information based on 17th July 2026 in-game announcement-->
Celebrate 13 Years of The Battle Cats!<br>
A BIG thanks to all our players, from those around since the beginning, to new players just now discovering the fun of The Battle Cats!<br>
The Nyanko Rangers have arrived for the first time - but they'll need you on their side to make sure it won't be their last!

On from<br>
{{Color|#660000|'''June 19, 2026 (11:00 AM) until August 3, 2026 (10:59 AM)'''}}

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・The Wildcat Slots II return for more huge payouts!'''}}<br>
Visit the Cat Base during the times below to take a spin at the {{Color|#6D9EEB|'''13th Anniversary Wildcat Slots II'''}}!

On from<br>
{{Color|#660000|'''July 15 (11:00 AM) until August 3 (10:59 AM)'''}}

{{Color|#B45F06|'''Earn 1013 Cat Food or more'''}} with a simple pull at the Wildcat Slots II!<br>
Don't miss this opportunity to earn gigantic rewards!

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・A wide array of special events!'''}}<br>
For a limited time, take advantage of tons of special stages and events to smooth your road to victory in The Battle Cats!

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Get half off the Cat Energy costs in Empire of Cats, Into the Future, and Cats of the Cosmos!'''}}<br>
・Challenge stages for half off the Cat Energy costs in the Story Mode chapters of {{Color|#0000FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, {{Color|#9900FF|'''Into the Future'''}}, and {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}}!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Half-off Cat Energy is available after clearing the "Korea" stage of Empire of Cats Ch. 1.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited Sale: Get Special Units for 50% off their usual Cat Food cost!'''}}<br>
For a limited time, unlock Special Units for half of their normal Cat Food cost!<br>
Don't miss this chance to grab a favorite Cat or two!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Legend Ticket Sale for the 13th Anniversary!'''}}<br>
A secret hero of legend could be yours after purchasing a Legend Ticket.<br>
The Legend Capsules guarantee you 1 Uber Rare or Legend Rare unit!

On from<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''July 3 (11:00 AM) until August 3, 2026 (10:59 AM)'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Only one Legend Ticket can be purchased per player during the event.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Limited seasonal units, collab units, and exclusive limited units from other Capsules sets are not available in the Legend Capsules.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Super Limited Unit: "Gacha Cat" ON SALE!'''}}<br>
Limited Special unit "Gacha Cat" is available in a special sale bundle with bonus Cat Food, just for the 13th anniversary!<br>
Grab this sale pack to enjoy a few thrilling draws from the Rare Capsules!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Only one "Gacha Cat" sale pack can be purchased per player. This offer will not appear if already purchased.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 13th Anniversary stages on now!'''}}<br>
Tons of limited Anniversary stages for you to enjoy!<br>
Earn Cat Ticket, XP, and battle item rewards upon Victory!

During this event, visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages from The Battle Cats title menu to take on these challenges.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● "Cybear's Vengeance" Returns!'''}}<br>
Get huge Cat Ticket rewards by defeating a terrifying metal bear!<br>
This stage will reset at 12:00 AM every Friday, giving you {{Color|#B45F06|'''6 total chances available to clear it for rewards'''}}!

Reward(s):<br>
5 Cat Tickets

