{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Catclaw Dojo Challenges'''}}<br>
Bring your best units to the battlefield to overcome this intense challenge!

On from<br>
{{Color|#B45F06|'''July 3 (11:00 AM) until August 3, 2026 (10:59 AM)'''}}

Visit the Catclaw Dojo during this event to test your Cats at the Arena of Honor!<br>

Climb to the highest tiers of power as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players! Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn special rewards when your final high score determines your skill tier.<br>
Expect better rewards than usual to celebrate the 13th anniversary of The Battle Cats!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Thanks for your patience!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor. Your score and ranking will be reset when the event ends.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.

